  "about": {"title": "Flow with guide tufts", "description": "Short coat that follows painted direction arrows everywhere, and your guides (clumped) where you paint the guideAreas map white, for longer hair or tufts (a ruff, a mane, ear tufts). The map starts black, all fur: paint it white in Groom Tools > Paint where the guides should take over.", "category": "Fur"},
  "exposed": [
